# Ledger installs the published packages rather than linking to the workspace, because
# linking would test the monorepo rather than the packaging. It resolves @mimnets from npm
# proper, which is the whole point of this Site: a workspace link would test the monorepo.
#
# There is no registry override here any more. Until 6 September 2026 this pointed at the
# Verdaccio container from docker-compose.yml, and the lockfile carried integrity hashes
# from that disposable volume (A-14) — hashes no other machine could reproduce.
